    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3ae4fd19-885a-58a2-b23a-55d534b04909" activityNameId="2d1c9d1d-5af9-5f29-a56d-0f0ce4455b54" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyvinylchloride, emulsion polymerised, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyvinylchloride, emulsion polymerised, at plant
A methane emissions update has been incorporated into the LCI of datasets downloaded from the PlasticsEurope website. UUID=015cd7db-8a64-3f0b-ba15-6ff81e3d1eb4
The polymer  process, upstream processes like propylene production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Location: EU27 including Norway and Switzerland
Technology: The polymerisation process, upstream processes like ethylene, chlorine, and VCM production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.

Time period: time to which data mainly refer: 2013 with the methane emission updates in 2023
Production volume: referring to covered E-PVC nameplate capacity (83 % of 791 kt in 2013)
Sampling: Questionnaires sent out to all production units in Europe operated by ECVM member companies.
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_015cd7db-8a64-3f0b-ba15-6ff81e3d1eb4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
